<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="489970554"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1856773946"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ever be my love"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="山田タマル"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ『終末なにしてますか？忙しいですか？救ってもらっていいですか？』オリジナルサウンドトラック「青い記憶」"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:51.830"><div begin="00:10.530" end="02:51.830"><p begin="00:10.530" end="00:15.850" itunes:key="L1">Hey, hey, hey</p><p begin="00:15.850" end="00:20.970" itunes:key="L2">Hey, hey, hey</p><p begin="00:20.970" end="00:26.190" itunes:key="L3">To the point of access you, I'll always be ahead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了能与你在一起 我会勇往直前</span></p><p begin="00:26.190" end="00:31.090" itunes:key="L4">If you go without your joy, I chase you with my hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你离开 即使伤心难过 我也会默默地为你加油鼓劲</span></p><p begin="00:31.090" end="00:36.210" itunes:key="L5">Through the window you have been, you've always been in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管你翘首以盼 可你一直沐浴在爱里</span></p><p begin="00:36.210" end="00:42.190" itunes:key="L6">If you go without no tears, sad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你离开 强忍泪水也悲痛不已</span></p><p begin="00:42.190" end="00:51.260" itunes:key="L7">Why we're born to this life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我们生来要面对这样的人生</span></p><p begin="00:51.260" end="00:55.650" itunes:key="L8">When the dawn is close inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明即将来临</span></p><p begin="00:55.650" end="01:01.590" itunes:key="L9">We never say goodbye, and never see again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们无法将再见说出口 可我们明白再也见不到彼此</span></p><p begin="01:01.590" end="01:05.900" itunes:key="L10">So the morning I'll live with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我甘愿承受分别的痛苦</span></p><p begin="01:05.900" end="01:11.040" itunes:key="L11">As ever, been my love, you've ever been the one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往 你是我的挚爱 你一直都是我的唯一</span></p><p begin="01:11.040" end="01:16.810" itunes:key="L12">I love you more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会更加爱你</span></p><p begin="01:16.810" end="01:22.860" itunes:key="L13">Oh, oh, oh, oh</p><p begin="01:22.860" end="01:28.100" itunes:key="L14">To avoid a joy that something gives you in your time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你不开心时 我会为你排忧解难</span></p><p begin="01:28.100" end="01:32.970" itunes:key="L15">If you lived, if you decide to compromise your dreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你难以割舍 如果你决定为了梦想妥协</span></p><p begin="01:32.970" end="01:38.090" itunes:key="L16">To the wind blows you have been, I'll always send you love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿风将我的爱带给你 我无怨无悔地爱着你</span></p><p begin="01:38.090" end="01:44.250" itunes:key="L17">Even I cannot reach it you at last<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我最后无法与你天长地久</span></p><p begin="01:44.250" end="01:53.210" itunes:key="L18">Why we're come to this life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我们要面对这一切</span></p><p begin="01:53.210" end="01:57.620" itunes:key="L19">When we've done it all, besides<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我们已竭尽所能</span></p><p begin="01:57.620" end="02:03.500" itunes:key="L20">We ever given all each other heart and faith<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾给过彼此真心 完全信任对方</span></p><p begin="02:03.500" end="02:07.820" itunes:key="L21">All the morning we will see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个清晨冥思苦想 我们终会明白</span></p><p begin="02:07.820" end="02:13.930" itunes:key="L22">As ever, be my love, you've ever be the one forevermore<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一如既往地爱你 你永远是我的唯一</span></p><p begin="02:13.930" end="02:18.310" itunes:key="L23">When the dawn is close inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明即将来临</span></p><p begin="02:18.310" end="02:24.040" itunes:key="L24">We never say goodbye, and never see again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们无法将再见说出口 可我们明白再也见不到彼此</span></p><p begin="02:24.040" end="02:28.350" itunes:key="L25">So the morning I'll live with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我甘愿承受分别的痛苦</span></p><p begin="02:28.350" end="02:33.510" itunes:key="L26">As ever, been my love, you've ever been the one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往 你是我的挚爱 你一直都是我的唯一</span></p><p begin="02:33.510" end="02:38.930" itunes:key="L27">I love you more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会更加爱你</span></p><p begin="02:38.930" end="02:43.430" itunes:key="L28">Oh-oh-oh-oh</p><p begin="02:43.430" end="02:48.960" itunes:key="L29">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh, ah-ah</p><p begin="02:48.960" end="02:51.830" itunes:key="L30">Ay-yeah-ay</p></div></body></tt>